NEXT_PUBLIC_INFORMATION=Enable Video Web Cam and Microphone to Start your AI Generated Mock Interview, It Has 5 questions which you can answer and at the end you will get the report on the basis of your answers. NOTE: We never record your video, Web cam access you can disable at any time if you want.

NEXT_PUBLIC_QUESTION_NOTE=Click on Record Answer when you want to answer the question. At the end of interview we will give you the feedback along with correct answer for each question and your answer to compare it.
